   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Heavy matte fade: blacks lifted to ~52 (grey fade), dark median (~96), yellow-warm midtones (~137/112/78) and highlights (~216/206/181), saturation 0.38, warm skin. Best for: Editorial / fashion-style couple portraits, palace and heritage venues (sandstone, marble), golden-hour frames, moody indoor portraits. Very stylised; use variation 02 or 03 for mixed galleries.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
